  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for support of South Feminist Futures&apos; institutional and operating infrastructure development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Feminist Futures is a membership organization established and launched in 2020. It is led by women and trans and nonbinary people from across the Global South and Black, Indigenous, and people of color who are women and trans and nonbinary in the Global North. It is focused on strengthening South feminist movements with a view to better equipping them to enact transformative and radical changes at global, regional, and local levels. This grant will contribute to setting up the institutional and operating infrastructure of South Feminist Futures as an association.</narrative>
  </description>
